WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.615
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.615 --> 00:00:06.102
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.102 --> 00:00:09.602
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.602 --> 00:00:09.923
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:11.815
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.815 --> 00:00:15.448
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.462 --> 00:00:20.807
Filter the blackboard to focus on Training.

00:00:20.807 --> 00:00:25.664
Follow the training flow down to parameter updates.

00:00:25.664 --> 00:00:31.025
Switch the diagram to Inference.

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:35.784
Inspect the fixed-parameter step in the inference flow.

00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:39.078
Restore Both processes for a side-by-side comparison.

00:00:39.078 --> 00:00:44.465
Reveal the first check about a definition added to the prompt.

00:00:44.465 --> 00:00:49.946
Reveal the check about what pretraining updates.

00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:53.241
Reveal the check about changed outputs with fixed parameters.

00:00:53.241 --> 00:00:58.302
Hide all three explanations at once for another independent attempt.

00:00:58.302 --> 00:01:03.223
Reveal all three explanations with the collective control.

00:01:03.223 --> 00:01:10.754
Inspect the complete check counter and the shared controls.
